    phase4/buildp3.sh <guest-dir> <out>/<case>.wasm

which is, after checking the core module (no wasi_snapshot_preview1 import, only wasi: imports, the
three exports, an unshared memory):

    GOOS=wasip3 GOARCH=wasm bin/go -C <guest-dir> build -trimpath -o <case>.core.wasm .
    wasm-tools component embed --world wasi:cli/command@0.3.0 phase4/wit-wasi-0.3.0 <case>.core.wasm \
        -o <case>.embedded.wasm
